https://github.com/aleksUIX/pixellint

A validator for pixels, postbacks, and other measurement artifacts. Checks
URL-level conformance against published web standards and checks vendor
endpoint parameters against the contracts those vendors document.

Pixellint is not affiliated with or endorsed by Meta, Google, TikTok,
LinkedIn, or any other vendor named in its rulepacks. Vendor names and
endpoint identifiers appear only to describe which endpoints a rulepack
covers. Rulepacks contain structured parameter metadata (parameter names,
value formats, and documentation URLs) written from public documentation;
they do not reproduce vendor documentation text.

